sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as User
    participant Frontend as Frontend
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant DB as Metadata DB

    User->>Frontend: Open report builder
    Frontend->>API: Request report defaults
    API->>DB: Load saved report defaults
    DB-->>API: Return saved defaults
    API-->>Frontend: Return report defaults
    Frontend-->>User: Render initial builder state
    User->>Frontend: Change grouping and filters
    Frontend->>API: Preview report query
    API->>DB: Validate filter compatibility
    DB-->>API: Return filter validation result
    API-->>Frontend: Return preview summary
    User->>Frontend: Confirm report generation
    Frontend->>API: Submit final report job
    API->>DB: Persist report job with pending status
    DB-->>API: Return report job id
    API-->>Frontend: Return accepted report job
    Frontend-->>User: Show queued report state
    Frontend->>API: Poll report state
    API->>DB: Load latest report state
    DB-->>API: Return running report progress
    API-->>Frontend: Return running progress payload
    Frontend-->>User: Refresh running state
    Frontend->>API: Poll report state again
    API->>DB: Load final report state
    DB-->>API: Return completed report with download metadata
    API-->>Frontend: Return completed report payload
    Frontend-->>User: Show completed report summary
